<title>THAILAND: Surveyors report Thai November ship discharges.</title>
<headline>Surveyors report Thai November ship discharges.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships are scheduled to arrive at Thai ports to unload their cargoes in November, according to independent surveyors on Wednesday.</p>
<p>  Vessel	     Arrival	  Commodity	Quantity (tns)</p>
<p> Northern Light    8/11/96	  ARG soymeal	25,193</p>
<p> Kavo Kaliakra    10/11/96	  BRZ soy pellets  53,789</p>
<p> Vega T	     23/11/96	  BRZ soymeal	20,000</p>
<p> Toscana	    25/11/96	  ARG/BRZ soymeal  45,000</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
